Package: lazydraws
Title: Lazy Posterior Draws in Parquet Files
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Noa", "Kallioinen", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "33577035+n-kall@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Stream CmdStanR sampling output to Parquet files using DuckDB.
    Query selected variables and draw indices directly into posterior draws
    objects while keeping the source on disk. No Arrow or dplyr dependency is required.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    DBI,
    duckdb (>= 2.0.0),
    posterior (>= 1.5.0)
Suggests:
    cmdstanr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Additional_repositories: https://stan-dev.r-universe.dev
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
